<title>USA: St Paul cattle trade $1.00-1.50 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul cattle trade $1.00-1.50 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compared to Thursday, slaughter steers and heifers $1.00 to 1.50 higher. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers:  Choice 2-4 1000-1375 lbs 62.50-64.70. Select and Choice 2-3 1050-1250 lbs 61.50-62.50. Select 2-3 58.50-61.50.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: Choice 2-4 1050-1225 lbs 62.00-64.00, lot 959 lbs 60.00. Select and Choice 2-3 1100-1275 lbs 60.50-62.00.</p>
</text>
